# 5. FIREBASE AUTH FLOW

Implement the complete Google authentication lifecycle:

```text
App Start
   ↓
Firebase Initialization
   ↓
Check Auth State
   ├── authenticated
   │       ↓
   │   Load user profile/data
   │
   └── unauthenticated
           ↓
       Login Screen
           ↓
       Google Sign-In
           ↓
       Firebase Auth
           ↓
       Create/update user profile
           ↓
       Application
```

Handle:

* first login
* returning user
* cancelled Google login
* authentication failure
* Firebase failure
* account state changes
* sign out
* app restart
* missing/incomplete profile
* expired/invalid authentication state

Never duplicate authentication logic inside multiple screens.

