# 18. PERFORMANCE

Optimize only where it provides real value.

Avoid:

* unnecessary rebuilds
* unnecessary Firebase listeners
* repeated database reads
* downloading excessive data
* loading complete collections when only a small subset is required
* unnecessary image/network operations
* expensive work inside `build()`

Dispose listeners/controllers/resources correctly.

Do not create permanent RTDB listeners when a one-time read is sufficient.

